# Copy to scripts/.env (gitignored) and fill in.
# Used by scripts/deploy_testflight.sh. Pick ONE of the two blocks.

# --- Option A: App Store Connect API key (preferred) -------------------------
# App Store Connect > Users and Access > Integrations > App Store Connect API.
# Generate a key with the "App Manager" role (or "Admin" if you also want the
# script's automatic signing to be able to create a distribution certificate).
# The .p8 downloads exactly once — keep it outside the repo.
#
# ASC_KEY_ID=XXXXXXXXXX
# ASC_ISSUER_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
# ASC_KEY_PATH=~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8

# --- Option B: Apple ID + app-specific password ------------------------------
# appleid.apple.com > Sign-In and Security > App-Specific Passwords.
# Note this only authenticates the *upload*; archiving still needs a
# distribution certificate already present in the keychain (open the project in
# Xcode once with the account signed in, and it will create one).
#
# ASC_APPLE_ID=you@example.com
# ASC_APP_PASSWORD=abcd-efgh-ijkl-mnop
